{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Superball is a futuristic reimagining of football with fast-paced 3v3 matches full of action. Enter the field with a team of heroes, score against the other team while defending your own goal and win! Show your skill in classic matches, battle for the top spots in ranked games and have fun in arcade modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/7da6d4050deefdd3c70060e1b4061e61.avif?t=1760435540\" width=600 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/504f7aa2bc3327147f81d8c6e7283b88.poster.avif?t=1760435540\" width=600 height=207 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/504f7aa2bc3327147f81d8c6e7283b88.webm?t=1760435540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over a dozen characters to choose from, with a new hero joining the cast every season! Each character has a unique appearance, personality and a set of abilities, complete with a powerful ultimate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/3b6694e4543a2342d26b09e270286e0f.avif?t=1760435540\" width=600 height=71 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/5141773fc8724fce3b5236bebd69d7d3.poster.avif?t=1760435540\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/5141773fc8724fce3b5236bebd69d7d3.webm?t=1760435540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero brings unique abilities to the field \u2014 but it's the way you combine them that sparks real magic. Will you pull off the highlight play, or end up on someone else's? That\u2019s up to you, champ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/2821e769959d74d20b6a27e2b2fcfc01.avif?t=1760435540\" width=600 height=71 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/8c9bcffd3caaa00d8e5e8f2ad160a409.poster.avif?t=1760435540\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/8c9bcffd3caaa00d8e5e8f2ad160a409.webm?t=1760435540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the flashiest hero has weaknesses. That\u2019s where team synergy shines. In a 3-player squad, coordination is easier than ever. So grab your best buddies and get ready to climb to the top together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/bc48d99f176647ee430223a5cea952e8.avif?t=1760435540\" width=600 height=71 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/11097a507f19c8e1d5758d96b8184c50.poster.avif?t=1760435540\" width=604 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/extras/11097a507f19c8e1d5758d96b8184c50.webm?t=1760435540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up the equipment and accessories of your heroes to create a look that is truly yours. Choose from hundreds of customization options.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Superball \u2014 here, it's not luck that wins. It's skill. Are you ready to hit the field?</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1059110?t=1760435540","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1059110?t=1760435540","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/c6e52beeb3590d198df5642cc56db263cc44a7dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760435540","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1059110/c6e52beeb3590d198df5642cc56db263cc44a7dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760435540","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1150150,"description":"Try out the game here!"}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Superball is a futuristic reimagining of football with fast-paced 3v3 matches full of action. Enter the field with a team of heroes, score against the other team while defending your own goal and win! Show your skill in classic matches, battle for the top spots in ranked games and have fun in arcade modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img c